<task id="SAMLPasswordBasedAuthentication-9BBEFB62" xml:lang="en-us" class="- topic/topic task/task "><title class="- topic/title ">SAML Password-based Authentication</title><shortdesc class="- topic/shortdesc ">Starting in <keyword conkeyref="wh_variables_n4/niagara4.14" class="- topic/keyword ">Niagara 4.14</keyword>, the SAML Authentication Scheme allows the
administrator to specify the type of authentication that is allowed
on the <keyword conkeyref="wh_variables_n4/Supervisor" conref="../reuse/WH_SoftwareVariables_Tridium_N4_0000009934.dita#WHSoftwareVariablesTridium-9A3264AE/Supervisor" class="- topic/keyword ">supervisor</keyword>.</shortdesc><prolog class="- topic/prolog "><metadata class="- topic/metadata "><keywords class="- topic/keywords "><indexterm class="- topic/indexterm ">Authentication Service<indexterm class="- topic/indexterm ">Authentication
Scheme</indexterm><indexterm class="- topic/indexterm ">SAML Authentication Scheme</indexterm><indexterm class="- topic/indexterm ">Requested Authentication Type</indexterm></indexterm></keywords></metadata></prolog><taskbody class="- topic/body task/taskbody "><prereq class="- topic/section task/prereq "><ul class="- topic/ul "><li class="- topic/li "><p class="- topic/p "><keyword conkeyref="wh_variables_n4/Workbench" conref="../reuse/WH_SoftwareVariables_Tridium_N4_0000009934.dita#WHSoftwareVariablesTridium-9A3264AE/Workbench" class="- topic/keyword ">Workbench</keyword> is running.</p></li><li class="- topic/li "><p class="- topic/p ">The <keyword conkeyref="wh_variables_n4/Supervisor" conref="../reuse/WH_SoftwareVariables_Tridium_N4_0000009934.dita#WHSoftwareVariablesTridium-9A3264AE/Supervisor" class="- topic/keyword ">supervisor</keyword> station is configured with the <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">SAMLIDPService</uicontrol> with <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">CircleofTrustFolder</uicontrol> configured.</p></li><li class="- topic/li "><p class="- topic/p ">Appropriate users are added in the <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">UserService</uicontrol> on the <keyword conkeyref="wh_variables_n4/Supervisor" conref="../reuse/WH_SoftwareVariables_Tridium_N4_0000009934.dita#WHSoftwareVariablesTridium-9A3264AE/Supervisor" class="- topic/keyword ">supervisor</keyword> station.</p></li></ul></prereq><?Pub Caret -1?><context class="- topic/section task/context "><p class="- topic/p "/></context><steps class="- topic/ol task/steps "><step class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">Open a platform connection for the remote controller and
connect to the station.</cmd></step><step class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">Expand <menucascade class="+ topic/ph ui-d/menucascade "><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Config</uicontrol><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Services</uicontrol><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">AuthenticationService</uicontrol><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Authentication Schemes</uicontrol></menucascade>, right-click <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">SAMLAuthenticationScheme</uicontrol> and click <menucascade class="+ topic/ph ui-d/menucascade "><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Views</uicontrol><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Property Sheet</uicontrol></menucascade>.</cmd><stepresult class="- topic/itemgroup task/stepresult ">The <wintitle class="+ topic/keyword ui-d/wintitle ">Property Sheet</wintitle> opens. </stepresult></step><step class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">In the <parmname class="+ topic/keyword pr-d/parmname ">Requested Authentication Type</parmname> property, click the pencil  icon.</cmd><stepresult class="- topic/itemgroup task/stepresult ">The <wintitle class="+ topic/keyword ui-d/wintitle ">Select Enums</wintitle> pane opens.</stepresult></step><step class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">Select the <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">PasswordProtectedTransport</uicontrol> type of authentication and click <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">OK</uicontrol>.</cmd></step><step class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">Open the Supervisor station using a web browser.</cmd></step><step class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">In the <wintitle class="+ topic/keyword ui-d/wintitle ">Login</wintitle> window, enter or verify
Username and click <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Log In with SSO</uicontrol>.</cmd></step><step class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">Enter your password and click <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Login</uicontrol>.</cmd><stepresult class="- topic/itemgroup task/stepresult ">If the credentials are correct, the login is successful and
a station view displays.<note class="- topic/note ">If successful, you can logout if desired.</note><p class="- topic/p ">You can change the authentication type as needed. When the authentication
type is modified, log in with the appropriate user (for example, if
the <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Time Sync Token</uicontrol> authentication type is
selected, the user should use the TOTP Authentication scheme).</p></stepresult></step></steps><result class="- topic/section task/result "/><example class="- topic/example "/><postreq class="- topic/section task/postreq "/></taskbody></task>